      "content": "he's still acting really groggy though... if i give him like 4 or 5 ounces of Pedialyte every couple hours instead of waiting 5 hours, would that help more? i really don't want to wake him up if he's sleeping, but i'm scared he's too dehydrated. is it okay to just push the fluids more frequently to be safe?",
